{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-ladybird-peppa-pig-and-hey-duggee-books-2602-0022","content_id":"1d7dab94-a031-4f5d-a343-e68633913f02","description":"Product Recall for Ladybird Peppa Pig and Hey Duggee Books presenting a risk of choking.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"c67c0485-22b6-491d-b4d5-27ef13671828","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-02-06T20:43:46+00:00","id":"c67c0485-22b6-491d-b4d5-27ef13671828","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-02-06T20:43:46+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6986528285bc7d6ba0fbc76f/2602-0022-product-recall-ladybird-books-various.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Ladybird Peppa Pig and Hey Duggee Books</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of choking as small parts can lift and flake off the book.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Books</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Ladybird Books</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Printings</td>\n      <td>2020 and 2021</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>United Kingdom</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Specific printings of softcover picture books for children, four featuring Peppa Pig and one featuring Hey Duggee characters. Access the below linked PDF for information on identifying the unique print number.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_c67c0485-22b6-491d-b4d5-27ef13671828\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6986528285bc7d6ba0fbc76f/2602-0022-product-recall-ladybird-books-various.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"affected-products\">Affected Products</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Book Name</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">ISBN</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Unique Print Number</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Peppa Pig: Peppa Meets Father Christmas</td>\n      <td>9780241321539</td>\n      <td>009</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Peppa Pig: Peppa’s Night Before Christmas</td>\n      <td>9780241448625</td>\n      <td>002 &amp; 003</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Peppa Pig: Peppa Loves Easter</td>\n      <td>9780241476406</td>\n      <td>002</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Peppa Pig: Peppa Goes to Hollywood</td>\n      <td>9780241476772</td>\n      <td>002 &amp; 003</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Hey Duggee: Duggee and the Christmas Badge</td>\n      <td>9781405947350</td>\n      <td>003</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The products present a risk of choking as the glitter varnish finish on the cover can lift and flake off, creating small parts. These small parts pose a choking hazard to children, particularly those under 36 months of age who have a natural tendency to explore objects by placing them in their mouths.</p>\n\n<p>The products do not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The products have been recalled from end users by Ladybird Books Limited.\nWe recommend that owners keep these products out of reach of young children and return it to the distributor for a full refund.</p>\n\n<p>For more information, please access: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.penguin.co.uk/about/company-articles/product-recall-peppa-pig-and-hey-duggee-books\">Penguin Recall Page</a> or contact <a href=\"mailto:customersupport@penguinrandomhouse.co.uk\">customersupport@penguinrandomhouse.co.uk</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2602-0022</p>\n\n<p>Lead Authority: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-06T20:44:07Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"headers":[{"id":"affected-products","level":3,"text":"Affected Products"}],"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-02-06","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-02-06T20:44:07+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-ladybird-peppa-pig-and-hey-duggee-books-2602-0022","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-ladybird-peppa-pig-and-hey-duggee-books-2602-0022","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-ladybird-peppa-pig-and-hey-duggee-books-2602-0022","content_id":"1d7dab94-a031-4f5d-a343-e68633913f02","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-02-06T20:44:07Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Ladybird Peppa Pig and Hey Duggee Books (2602-0022)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-ladybird-peppa-pig-and-hey-duggee-books-2602-0022","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","a